# The matrix in the sequence: a track's LENGTH, HITS and ROTATE (the steps never change), and CHANCE's settings
wait 300
# LFO > MATRIX: a track's PARAM turns through its knobs, LENGTH, then HITS and ROTATE
tap LFO
wait 150
expect page MATRIX
turn K1 1
wait 60
turn K3 1
wait 40
turn K3 1
wait 40
turn K3 1
wait 40
